Close Harbor's egress lock around a task: check every DNS packet before any NAT or local exemption and pass only
single A or AAAA questions for exact allowlisted names, in any case; pass only ICMP errors for tracked traffic and
link-scoped neighbour discovery; take raw-socket and network-administration powers from the task's containers; and
keep the rules, with the allowlist emptied, when the sidecar exits while the task's containers run.
